@startuml CU-20
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (carrito de compras)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /cart" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CartService / Cart / Sale / Payment" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: abrir carrito
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /cart
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_active_cart(db, user_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: CartRead
Ctrl --> UI : 5: CartRead
UI --> Cli : 6: carrito mostrado

Cli -> UI : 7: actualizar cantidad
UI -> Ctrl : 8: PATCH /cart/items/{variant_id}
Ctrl -> Model : 9: update_item(db, cart, variant_id, quantity)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: CartRead actualizado
Ctrl --> UI : 11: total recalculado

Cli -> UI : 12: quitar prenda
UI -> Ctrl : 13: DELETE /cart/items/{variant_id}
Ctrl -> Model : 14: remove_item(db, cart, variant_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 15: CartRead
Ctrl --> UI : 16: carrito sin la prenda

Cli -> UI : 17: comprar carrito
UI -> Ctrl : 18: POST /cart/purchase
Ctrl -> Model : 19: create_sale + pay + desactivar carrito
Model --> Ctrl : 20: PurchaseResponse {sale, payment}
Ctrl --> UI : 21: PurchaseResponse
UI --> Cli : 22: avanza al flujo de pago (CU-21)

@enduml